{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00967","headline":"横吹曲辞 入塞曲 二 · 沈彬","name":"横吹曲辞 入塞曲 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦战沙间卧箭痕，戍楼闲上望星文。\n生希国泽分偏将，死夺河源荅圣君。\n鸢覰败兵眠白草，马惊边鬼哭阴云。\n功多地远无人纪，汉阁笙歌日又曛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}